      "title": "VPN Network I/O",
      "description": "Raw gluetun VPN interface throughput. JDownloader2 shares gluetun's network namespace and has no independent network interface or application metrics. This shows total VPN traffic including all download clients (jdownloader2, qbittorrent, sabnzbd).",
